OL,3,A'Skimpflation' warning as tinned
OL,4,Amackerel alternative hits more
OL,5,Asupermarket shelves
OL,6,
OL,7,FA growing trend of supermarkets selling
OL,8,Fa cheaper, less nutritious alternative
OL,9,Fto tinned mackerel is an example of
OL,10,F"skimpflation", a consumer group has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FPrinces - which supplies major
OL,14,Fsupermarkets - has substituted the fish
OL,15,Ffor jack mackerel, an entirely
OL,16,Fdifferent species also being sold by
OL,17,FLidl.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,109,105,200,300,0,100
