OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Skimpflation' warning as tinned
OL,4,Amackerel alternative hits more
OL,5,Asupermarket shelves
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe switch has been spurred by
OL,8,Fdwindling stocks of Atlantic mackerel
OL,9,Fafter years of overfishing, with its
OL,10,FChilean counterpart more sustainable
OL,11,Fand a third of the cost.
OL,13,F"It's a real concern when manufacturers
OL,14,Fquietly downgrade everyday staples like
OL,15,Fthese as shoppers can end up paying the
OL,16,Fsame price for a product that delivers
OL,17,Fsignificantly less nutritional
OL,18,Fquality," Sue Davies, head of food
OL,19,Fpolicy at Which?, said.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
